# The C++ style of the server, the client and the Android bridge (server/, android/native/),
# as close to the code as written as clang-format gets: Google's style, 120 columns, include
# blocks kept as they are (sorted within each). CI checks the lines a pull request changes
# (.github/scripts/check-format.sh, with the clang-format version pinned there); the rest of the
# code is formatted in one commit of its own, listed in .git-blame-ignore-revs.
BasedOnStyle: Google
Standard: c++20
ColumnLimit: 120
IncludeBlocks: Preserve
